### Code Analysis

```java
/**
 * Compute the linear combination a<sub>1</sub> b<sub>1</sub> + ... + a<sub>n</sub> b<sub>n</sub>
 * with high accuracy, two times on Java 5 and later and otherwise.
 *
 * @param a Factors.
 * @param b Factors.
 * @return the sum of the products for each element
 */
public static double linearCombination(double[] a, double[] b) {
    MathArrays.checkEqualLength(a, b);

    final int len = a.length;
    if (len == 1) {
        return a[0] * b[0];
    }

    if (len >= 32) {
        return largeArrayDotProduct(a, b);
    }

    return  aDotB(a, b);
}
```

